cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "camtrapReport" in publications, please use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'camtrapReport: Camera-Trap Report Generator'
version: '1.0.49'

abstract: >-
  Provides an extensible workflow for processing camera-trap data in the
  'Camtrap DP' format and automatically generating reproducible data-status
  and ecological reports. The package supports data-quality checks,
  ecological summaries, visualisations, maps, tables and modular report
  sections for wildlife-monitoring applications.

authors:
